atch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(T_\\alpha,T,&lt;_T,\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(T_\\alpha,T,&lt;_T,\\alpha)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da1d07bee8918b64\" href=\"?note=da1d07bee8918b64\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree-level.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree-level.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\\)</span> (Suslin-tree predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S(T,&lt;_T,\\omega_1)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\;\\forall T_\\alpha\\subseteq T\\;(\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(T_\\alpha,T,&lt;_T,\\alpha)\\to|T_\\alpha|\\leq\\aleph_0)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq T\\;\\Bigl((\\forall x,y\\in C\\;(x&lt;_T y\\lor x=y\\lor y&lt;_T x))\\to|C|\\leq\\aleph_0\\Bigr)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq T\\;\\Bigl((\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\neq y\\to(\\neg(x&lt;_T y)\\land\\neg(y&lt;_T x))))\\to|A|\\leq\\aleph_0\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S(T,&lt;_T,\\omega_1)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\;\\forall T_\\alpha\\subseteq T\\;(\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(T_\\alpha,T,&lt;_T,\\alpha)\\to|T_\\alpha|\\leq\\aleph_0)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq T\\;\\Bigl((\\forall x,y\\in C\\;(x&lt;_T y\\lor x=y\\lor y&lt;_T x))\\to|C|\\leq\\aleph_0\\Bigr)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq T\\;\\Bigl((\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(x\\neq y\\to(\\neg(x&lt;_T y)\\land\\neg(y&lt;_T x))))\\to|A|\\leq\\aleph_0\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","l